zany lawkeepers. "The Kops are charged with maintaining a reasonable
level of law, order, and wacky slapstick antics.", he said at a press
meeting in Delphi. "We don't investigate murders. We did, however,
ensure that the mysterious adventurer refrained from looting the shop
until its erstwhile resident was, in fact, dead."
